# Slide-In Animation Test
# Animations are NOT disabled - captures the slide-in at different timings
# Scripts 01-09 call disable_animations, and the instant flag is a
# process-wide global, so re-enable here or every frame is settled.

enable_animations
goto_screen Main
wait 0.05
screenshot anim_01_early

wait 0.15
screenshot anim_02_mid

wait 0.3
screenshot anim_03_settling

wait 0.5
screenshot anim_04_complete
